{"id":"4fa15b19c682f360","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-existelim.md","title":"Existential elimination for Boolean equations","display":"thm-existelim — Existential elimination for Boolean equations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-existelim","aliases":["27-thm-existelim"],"display":"thm-existelim — Existential elimination for Boolean equations","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-restrict]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-existelim"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-existelim</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-existelim — Existential elimination for Boolean equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9964b0194f4fb6e6\" href=\"?note=9964b0194f4fb6e6\" title=\"27-df-restrict\">27-df-restrict</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> (Boolean function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{i\\leftarrow b}\">\\(f_{i\\leftarrow b}\\)</span> (restriction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9964b0194f4fb6e6\" href=\"?note=9964b0194f4fb6e6\" title=\"27-df-restrict\">27-df-restrict</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span> (pointwise conjunction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\;\\bigl(\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(f_{i\\leftarrow b}(y)=0)\\leftrightarrow(f_{i\\leftarrow0}\\land f_{i\\leftarrow1})(y)=0\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\;\\bigl(\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(f_{i\\leftarrow b}(y)=0)\\leftrightarrow(f_{i\\leftarrow0}\\land f_{i\\leftarrow1})(y)=0\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For the zero-set equation convention, existential elimination uses conjunction of the two cofactors.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-restrict","status":"resolved","id":"9964b0194f4fb6e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-restrict]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (Boolean function, see [[27-df-boolfunc]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-restrict","status":"resolved","id":"9964b0194f4fb6e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f_{i\\leftarrow b}$ (restriction, see [[27-df-restrict]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\land$ (pointwise conjunction, see [[27-df-boolop]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f_{i\\leftarrow b}","display":false},{"tex":"\\land","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\;\\bigl(\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(f_{i\\leftarrow b}(y)=0)\\leftrightarrow(f_{i\\leftarrow0}\\land f_{i\\leftarrow1})(y)=0\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1035,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-existelim|thm-existelim — Existential elimination for Boolean equations]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","9964b0194f4fb6e6","11de8465f2282555"]}